text:
@google is doing the right thing to penalize memory abusing apps on Android.
@googlechrome though often uses ~1GB per tab on my Macbook Pro (89GB for 200 tabs). As an ex-Google SWE, we all need to clean up our act here and be more responsible. I think Software Engineers have needed and lacked a strong signal when their code is not being efficient. I have much respect for engineers that have thrived under much tighter constraints.
